ovide citations for each claim.\n\nThus answer: \"Dashboard Confessional released the 2006 single “Rooftops and Invitations,” while Escanaba Firing Line is an American rock band formed in Michigan in 2002.\" Provide citations: for Dashboard Confessional part, maybe use sentence 0 and 2. For Escanaba part, use sentence 0.\n\nReturn JSON with answer and citations list.\n\nCitations format: [document title, zero-based sentence index]. So:\n\n- [\"Rooftops and Invitations\",0] for the fact it's a Dashboard Confessional single.\n- [\"Rooftops and Invitations\",2] for release date 2006.\n- [\"Escanaba Firing Line\",0] for formation.\n\nWe could also include sentence 1 for Escanaba but not needed.\n\nThus final."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":376,"completion_tokens":611,"total_tokens":987,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791963027,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}